(4837341, 699412, 67553, '<td valign="top">Yum!  Good choice, going with a plain white background.  I really like the texture of the chocolate as it drips and folds over the bar.  Well done.</td>', 'Yum!  Good choice, going with a plain white background.  I really like the texture of the chocolate as it drips and folds over the bar.  Well done.', '2008-07-21 18:30:40.000000', NULL, 1),
