(4837346, 700246, 73452, '<td valign="top">there are some fingerprints on the fork, ahah nit-picky little me.  but that would be one sweet breakfast, hope you got to eat it!</td>', 'there are some fingerprints on the fork, ahah nit-picky little me.  but that would be one sweet breakfast, hope you got to eat it!', '2008-07-21 18:31:47.000000', NULL, 1),
