(4837353, 700246, 67553, '<td valign="top">Simple and well lit.  I like the composition, but the black handle of the knife draws the eye amidst all of the white.  I think an all silver knife would have worked better here.</td>', 'Simple and well lit.  I like the composition, but the black handle of the knife draws the eye amidst all of the white.  I think an all silver knife would have worked better here.', '2008-07-21 18:33:18.000000', NULL, 1),
