(4837367, 701274, 67553, '<td valign="top">The lighting seems a little drab here, maybe a bit underexposed.  With all that sugar, the whites should be truly white.</td>', 'The lighting seems a little drab here, maybe a bit underexposed.  With all that sugar, the whites should be truly white.', '2008-07-21 18:38:47.000000', NULL, 1),
