(4837557, 701260, 66524, '<td valign="top">wish the focus included more of the sugar in the background (DOF, but I don''t know how to use those terms very well yet).  Love the crispness on the spoon - and the reflection doesn''t bother me given the white of the sugar out weighs it.  Background it delightful</td>', 'wish the focus included more of the sugar in the background (DOF, but I don''t know how to use those terms very well yet).  Love the crispness on the spoon - and the reflection doesn''t bother me given the white of the sugar out weighs it.  Background it delightful', '2008-07-21 21:23:30.000000', NULL, 1),
