(4837561, 701165, 66524, '<td valign="top">WOW - a couple things I really like:<br/>the colors - this could be in a magazine!<br/>more importantly, I notice each piece has an interesting point in focus: top tip of the first to the narrow band on the second and how the focus washes across the last piece.  I suspect you have a great deal of control over your camera.  This photo has some outstanding compositional traits.</td>', 'WOW - a couple things I really like:the colors - this could be in a magazine!more importantly, I notice each piece has an interesting point in focus: top tip of the first to the narrow band on the second and how the focus washes across the last piece.  I suspect you have a great deal of control over your camera.  This photo has some outstanding compositional traits.', '2008-07-21 21:29:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(4837568, 701159, 66524, '<td valign="top">carbonated beverage? Out of the box thinking, I suspect. Creative idea for the challenge.</td>', 'carbonated beverage? Out of the box thinking, I suspect. Creative idea for the challenge.', '2008-07-21 21:34:59.000000', NULL, 1),
