(4837641, 701227, 62671, '<td valign="top">You will get points for the cute factor for certain.  The DOF is a bit to shallow for my taste on a shot like this.  The eyes which is supposed to be the most focus is just on the edge of the blur.  (not that anyone could tell.)<br/>The shadows are not harsh, a well executed image.</td>', 'You will get points for the cute factor for certain.  The DOF is a bit to shallow for my taste on a shot like this.  The eyes which is supposed to be the most focus is just on the edge of the blur.  (not that anyone could tell.)The shadows are not harsh, a well executed image.', '2008-07-21 22:18:08.000000', NULL, 1),
