(4837672, 701156, 20577, '<td valign="top">Not sure what asparagus has to do with sugar and graffiti, but if you think it does then I guess I might need to rethink what sugar is because to me sugar is like the stuff you put in tea and in cereal and asparagus is the stuff that makes your pee stink after you eat it. Have you ever noticed that? Like a day after you eat asparagus and your taking a whiz and all of a sudden you get this big wiff of rotten asparagus so you look in the stalls and notice there isn''t anyone taking a poop and then it hits you that it''s your pee that smells like rotten asparagus! Isn''t that like the grossest thing ever. It reminds me of this one time when I got a splinter in my hand and thought I had got it out, but like two weeks later I was pushing on my palm and BLAM out pops this big ol'' splinter and all this nasty puss came after it. It was totally gross kind of like when your pee smells like asparagus... asparagus... isn''t that a funny word? Who was the first moron who ate and said "I shall call this asparagus!"... you know, he probably named it something like delicorus, but a day after he ate it he smelled his pee and said this smells like @$$, so he changed his mind and call it asparagus, but didn''t want to spell it with the double s because nobody would buy something that started with ass. That reminds me of the Chevy Nova. Do you know that Nova means No Go in Spanish? Chevy tried to sell the Nova in Mexico and sales were horrible because of the name. I think they changed it to something better. If it was up to me I would have named it the Bandito! Beacause that is just a cool Mexican word and it sounds really tough. Anyway, I think this picture stinks like asparagus pee.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2008-08-04 08:08:45.</i></td>', 'Not sure what asparagus has to do with sugar and graffiti, but if you think it does then I guess I might need to rethink what sugar is because to me sugar is like the stuff you put in tea and 