(4838709, 701294, 24913, '<td valign="top">beautiful shot, but doesn''t make me think "sugar" more like asnd :(</td>', 'beautiful shot, but doesn''t make me think "sugar" more like asnd :(', '2008-07-22 15:57:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(4838714, 701330, 24913, '<td valign="top">cute play on words.... :)</td>', 'cute play on words.... :)', '2008-07-22 16:00:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(4838742, 700728, 90387, '<td valign="top">EXCELLENT idea, perfctly executed.  I have a feeling this will do very well, and it''s certainly one of my favorites thus far!</td>', 'EXCELLENT idea, perfctly executed.  I have a feeling this will do very well, and it''s certainly one of my favorites thus far!', '2008-07-22 16:19:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(4838749, 699642, 90387, '<td valign="top">great idea for the challenge, but what an excellent photo in general. composition, lighting, sharpness, all perfect in my book.  See ya on the front page.</td>', 'great idea for the challenge, but what an excellent photo in general. composition, lighting, sharpness, all perfect in my book.  See ya on the front page.', '2008-07-22 16:22:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(4838913, 701222, 93883, '<td valign="top">Ok I just have to say it, eww tongues are gross. Everything else about this picture is really great though!  The focus is good, you''ve hit just the right red, I like the high contrast, and I think the composition is perfect.  Although the desaturation works well, I think I would have liked it better with some really pale skin tone.</td>', 'Ok I just have to say it, eww tongues are gross. Everything else about this picture is really great though!  The focus is good, you''ve hit just the right red, I like the high contrast, and I think the composition is perfect.  Although the desaturation works well, I think I would have liked it better with some really pale skin tone.', '2008-07-22 18:23:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(4838918, 701161, 93883, '<td valign="top">I think this is a wonderful idea, but would rather have seen it with a solid background.  White on white would have been really great.  I also wish it weren''t quite so very blown out on the right, and softer shadows would have been nice.  Really a clever idea though!</td>', 'I think this is a wonderful idea, but would rather have seen it with a solid background.  White on white would have been really great.  I also wish it weren''t quite so very blown out on the right, and softer shadows would have been nice.  Really a clever idea though!', '2008-07-22 18:27:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(4838932, 701299, 93883, '<td valign="top">Wow that really does look like a person!  It took me at least 3 views before I realized it, this photo is officially way cooler than I thought it was :)  My suggestions would be first to crop it to make the subject more central, and a different colored background (maybe purple or blue) would be a nice contrast to the gold of the honey.</td>', 'Wow that really does look like a person!  It took me at least 3 views before I realized it, this photo is officially way cooler than I thought it was :)  My suggestions would be first to crop it to make the subject more central, and a different colored background (maybe purple or blue) would be a nice contrast to the gold of the honey.', '2008-07-22 18:35:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(4838941, 701246, 93883, '<td valign="top">eww another close-up of a tongue :)  the reds in this are really nice, and the focus on the lips is great.  Getting rid of the shadow on the face would have been good.  My favorite thing about this photo is the square crop and diagonal composition, it keeps your eye moving around the picture.</td>', 'eww another close-up of a tongue :)  the reds in this are really nice, and the focus on the lips is great.  Getting rid of the shadow on the face would have been good.  My favorite thing about this photo is the square crop and diagonal composition, it keeps your eye moving around the picture.', '2008-07-22 18:41:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(4838948, 701180, 93883, '<td valign="top">I think a slightly faster shutter speed would have been better, because right now it looks like that strawberry is getting pummeled!  Also, the strong lines take your eye straight out of the image.  Your focus is quite good though.</td>', 'I think a slightly faster shutter speed would have been better, because right now it looks like that strawberry is getting pummeled!  Also, the strong lines take your eye straight out of the image.  Your focus is quite good though.', '2008-07-22 18:44:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(4838956, 701316, 93883, '<td valign="top">Nice stop action and I like your choice of depth of field.  That medicine bottle is perfect!  Something about the composition isn''t working for me though.  Maybe if the spoon and sugar were coming in from a little more of an angle...I''m not sure what it is exactly...</td>', 'Nice stop action and I like your choice of depth of field.  That medicine bottle is perfect!  Something about the composition isn''t working for me though.  Maybe if the spoon and sugar were coming in from a little more of an angle...I''m not sure what it is exactly...', '2008-07-22 18:49:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(4838968, 700839, 93883, '<td valign="top">haha, she already has sugar on her nose.  This is my favorite of the horse and sugar pictures.  The close up crop and shallow depth of field tell the story simply without distractions.</td>', 'haha, she already has sugar on her nose.  This is my favorite of the horse and sugar pictures.  The close up crop and shallow depth of field tell the story simply without distractions.', '2008-07-22 18:54:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(4838977, 701309, 93883, '<td valign="top">Very cute!  nice colors, cute hairdo, and beautiful blue eyes!  I would have liked to have seen the whole picture in focus and a tighter crop on top though.</td>', 'Very cute!  nice colors, cute hairdo, and beautiful blue eyes!  I would have liked to have seen the whole picture in focus and a tighter crop on top though.', '2008-07-22 18:56:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(4838979, 700375, 93883, '<td valign="top">Too true, very clever idea and well executed.</td>', 'Too true, very clever idea and well executed.', '2008-07-22 18:57:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(4838983, 700757, 93883, '<td valign="top">Haha, great expression, you can just here him saying "sweet!" Bart Simpson style.</td>', 'Haha, great expression, you can just here him saying "sweet!" Bart Simpson style.', '2008-07-22 19:00:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(4838986, 701305, 93883, '<td valign="top">Minus the burnt out spots (I''m sure lighting was tough) I really like this picture alot.  Very artsy :)</td>', 'Minus the burnt out spots (I''m sure lighting was tough) I really like this picture alot.  Very artsy :)', '2008-07-22 19:03:07.000000', NULL, 1),
