(4841739, 700446, 90495, '<td valign="top">There''s a flatness to this i''m sure you weren''t going for. Even the strawberries don''t pop. I like the comp. but the lack of shadows and contrast just doesn''t do it for this setup.</td>', 'There''s a flatness to this i''m sure you weren''t going for. Even the strawberries don''t pop. I like the comp. but the lack of shadows and contrast just doesn''t do it for this setup.', '2008-07-23 20:51:58.000000', NULL, 1),
