(4843059, 700970, 77192, '<td valign="top">always shoot in RAW, silly ;-)<br/> <br/>I''d possibly rearrange the components of this pic a little. Perhaps lose the cup or move it back so it''s more OOF and less distracting. Then move the two sugar bowls so they''re level and side-by-side. The way it looks now, it almost looks as ifthe frontmost sugarbowl is from a different shot, (although that might be your PP) hence you''ve had it validated.<br/> <br/>On the whole though, I like this. It''s got a nice range of tones and colours and is well lit.</td>', 'always shoot in RAW, silly ;-) I''d possibly rearrange the components of this pic a little. Perhaps lose the cup or move it back so it''s more OOF and less distracting. Then move the two sugar bowls so they''re level and side-by-side. The way it looks now, it almost looks as ifthe frontmost sugarbowl is from a different shot, (although that might be your PP) hence you''ve had it validated. On the whole though, I like this. It''s got a nice range of tones and colours and is well lit.', '2008-07-24 15:02:44.000000', NULL, 1),
