(4844855, 701298, 30982, '<td valign="top">Without the title, I''d be a bit confused about the white substance, though knowing the challenge I''d probably guess confectioner''s sugar.  Good dtail in the sugar itself - good light, but the flower part gets a bit obscured as to what exactly it is and makes for a bit of an awkward composition.</td>', 'Without the title, I''d be a bit confused about the white substance, though knowing the challenge I''d probably guess confectioner''s sugar.  Good dtail in the sugar itself - good light, but the flower part gets a bit obscured as to what exactly it is and makes for a bit of an awkward composition.', '2008-07-25 16:27:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(4844857, 701216, 30982, '<td valign="top">Not sure of the need for the cricket, but it is different!  Good light and comp, good DOF.  With advanced editing, you could clone that one little hot spot on the cricket if you wanted to.</td>', 'Not sure of the need for the cricket, but it is different!  Good light and comp, good DOF.  With advanced editing, you could clone that one little hot spot on the cricket if you wanted to.', '2008-07-25 16:27:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(4844858, 699411, 30982, '<td valign="top">Good looking chocolate and meets the challenge, but the composition is a bit static and plain.</td>', 'Good looking chocolate and meets the challenge, but the composition is a bit static and plain.', '2008-07-25 16:28:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(4844859, 701295, 30982, '<td valign="top">Heh!!  Cute!  Processing may be over the top for some but it does suit the characters very well.</td>', 'Heh!!  Cute!  Processing may be over the top for some but it does suit the characters very well.', '2008-07-25 16:28:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(4844860, 701258, 30982, '<td valign="top">Would make a nice stock shot.  Good job at catching the drop before it fell, too.</td>', 'Would make a nice stock shot.  Good job at catching the drop before it fell, too.', '2008-07-25 16:29:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(4844861, 701175, 30982, '<td valign="top">Nice color and a very nice assortment!  Composition may be just a tad busy.</td>', 'Nice color and a very nice assortment!  Composition may be just a tad busy.', '2008-07-25 16:29:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(4844862, 701330, 30982, '<td valign="top">Great concept for the challenge!  And though I like a bit of sugar on my Cheerios, I do think that''s a tad too much!  The knife is just a wee bit dark, but the bowl and the sugar are lit very nicely.</td>', 'Great concept for the challenge!  And though I like a bit of sugar on my Cheerios, I do think that''s a tad too much!  The knife is just a wee bit dark, but the bowl and the sugar are lit very nicely.', '2008-07-25 16:30:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(4844864, 701334, 30982, '<td valign="top">Excellent portrait and still keeps to the challenge.</td>', 'Excellent portrait and still keeps to the challenge.', '2008-07-25 16:30:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(4844865, 701305, 30982, '<td valign="top">Very nice white on white!</td>', 'Very nice white on white!', '2008-07-25 16:31:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(4844867, 701180, 30982, '<td valign="top">Effective!  For the purists, the light may be a bit hot on the strawberry, but I like the end effect alot.</td>', 'Effective!  For the purists, the light may be a bit hot on the strawberry, but I like the end effect alot.', '2008-07-25 16:31:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(4844869, 701070, 30982, '<td valign="top">Meets the challenge as far as conveying "sweet" well, but isn''t a particularly intriguing shot.  Shooting from an angle and getting a bit of a shallower depth of field may be something to consider.</td>', 'Meets the challenge as far as conveying "sweet" well, but isn''t a particularly intriguing shot.  Shooting from an angle and getting a bit of a shallower depth of field may be something to consider.', '2008-07-25 16:32:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(4844870, 701327, 30982, '<td valign="top">Neat idea!  I like the minimalistic approach of this.</td>', 'Neat idea!  I like the minimalistic approach of this.', '2008-07-25 16:33:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(4844871, 700455, 30982, '<td valign="top">Would make a very nice stock shot, I think.</td>', 'Would make a very nice stock shot, I think.', '2008-07-25 16:33:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(4844872, 700737, 30982, '<td valign="top">Probably a stretch for the challenge given the literal interpretation most voters have, but it is a nifty way to get a pretty landscape into the challenge.</td>', 'Probably a stretch for the challenge given the literal interpretation most voters have, but it is a nifty way to get a pretty landscape into the challenge.', '2008-07-25 16:34:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(4844875, 701145, 30982, '<td valign="top">Cute!  The blouse, the background, and the powder sugar donut all combine to make this rather timeless.  Nicely done.</td>', 'Cute!  The blouse, the background, and the powder sugar donut all combine to make this rather timeless.  Nicely done.', '2008-07-25 16:34:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(4844877, 701270, 30982, '<td valign="top">Simple, direct, meets the challenge.</td>', 'Simple, direct, meets the challenge.', '2008-07-25 16:35:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(4844878, 701195, 30982, '<td valign="top">Somehow I figured there would be a few of these.  Not that that''s bad of course.  Pretty good job keeping the shot''s focus on the crystals.</td>', 'Somehow I figured there would be a few of these.  Not that that''s bad of course.  Pretty good job keeping the shot''s focus on the crystals.', '2008-07-25 16:35:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(4844879, 701168, 30982, '<td valign="top">Good job getting the motion of the sugar but somehow your strawberry got obscured and lost definition.  Black background is a good choice to keep the shot simple.</td>', 'Good job getting the motion of the sugar but somehow your strawberry got obscured and lost definition.  Black background is a good choice to keep the shot simple.', '2008-07-25 16:36:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(4844884, 701297, 30982, '<td valign="top">Beautiful shot of the horse and lovely bokeh to set it off.</td>', 'Beautiful shot of the horse and lovely bokeh to set it off.', '2008-07-25 16:38:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(4844885, 701324, 30982, '<td valign="top">Funeral for a friend?  I like how the gummies kinda glow.</td>', 'Funeral for a friend?  I like how the gummies kinda glow.', '2008-07-25 16:38:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(4844888, 701326, 30982, '<td valign="top">Very good closeup.</td>', 'Very good closeup.', '2008-07-25 16:39:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(4844889, 701323, 30982, '<td valign="top">Colorful, though I think the gummies are just a bit too small and overpowered by the M&amp;Ms, maybe.  Great clarity and light.</td>', 'Colorful, though I think the gummies are just a bit too small and overpowered by the M&Ms, maybe.  Great clarity and light.', '2008-07-25 16:39:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(4844966, 701283, 65779, '<td valign="top">I love this shot but fear that it is a bit subtle for the DPC crowd.  I give it a 9 though.</td>', 'I love this shot but fear that it is a bit subtle for the DPC crowd.  I give it a 9 though.', '2008-07-25 17:51:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(4844969, 701294, 65779, '<td valign="top">You needed one of those miniature feng shui rakes in this!</td>', 'You needed one of those miniature feng shui rakes in this!', '2008-07-25 17:52:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(4844970, 701145, 65779, '<td valign="top">annoyingly!</td>', 'annoyingly!', '2008-07-25 17:52:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(4845085, 700446, 63633, '<td valign="top">Australian for sure :)</td>', 'Australian for sure :)', '2008-07-25 20:44:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(4845262, 701159, 34171, '<td valign="top">Mmmmm looks so refreshing.  I''d love to have one right now.  Nice shot.</td>', 'Mmmmm looks so refreshing.  I''d love to have one right now.  Nice shot.', '2008-07-26 00:21:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(4845405, 700455, 96762, '<td valign="top">I think this is really clever.  great work.</td>', 'I think this is really clever.  great work.', '2008-07-26 04:03:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(4845407, 701227, 96762, '<td valign="top">haha.  i love it but i wish there wasnt so much white/light around the entire image.</td>', 'haha.  i love it but i wish there wasnt so much white/light around the entire image.', '2008-07-26 04:06:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(4845476, 701305, 11691, '<td valign="top">I love high key shots, looks like highlights got blown out a bit.</td>', 'I love high key shots, looks like highlights got blown out a bit.', '2008-07-26 08:10:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(4845478, 700031, 11691, '<td valign="top">Very humorous! may have rated higher if less arm was showing</td>', 'Very humorous! may have rated higher if less arm was showing', '2008-07-26 08:11:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(4845685, 701171, 37104, '<td valign="top">The focus here seems a little weird to me. I generally find it a bit weaker to focus on the midground of a still life. Sometimes it can work, but I think it looks just a bit awkward. The composition is also pretty busy. I can understand the need to make it interesting, but don''t try to hard to throw stuff in. The lighting, however, and I really like how the colors came out.</td>', 'The focus here seems a little weird to me. I generally find it a bit weaker to focus on the midground of a still life. Sometimes it can work, but I think it looks just a bit awkward. The composition is also pretty busy. I can understand the need to make it interesting, but don''t try to hard to throw stuff in. The lighting, however, and I really like how the colors came out.', '2008-07-26 15:38:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(4845687, 700728, 37104, '<td valign="top">I get where you were going with this, but it looks a little too blown out.</td>', 'I get where you were going with this, but it looks a little too blown out.', '2008-07-26 15:40:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(4845691, 701180, 554, '<td valign="top">My favorite.....hope ya don''t get dq''d</td>', 'My favorite.....hope ya don''t get dq''d', '2008-07-26 15:42:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(4845699, 700205, 37104, '<td valign="top">Focus is just way off.</td>', 'Focus is just way off.', '2008-07-26 15:46:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(4845789, 699969, 37104, '<td valign="top">I love it! It''s different. Very interesting composition, good colors. interesting focus. Nice Job.</td>', 'I love it! It''s different. Very interesting composition, good colors. interesting focus. Nice Job.', '2008-07-26 18:01:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(4845790, 700866, 37104, '<td valign="top">This is either a <img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_F.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_F.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_F.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=48228" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">sherpet</a> or a good sherpet-style shot. Either way, nicely done. Lighting seems a little dark, esp. on the right hand side, but the colors are really what do it for me.</td>', 'This is either a  sherpet or a good sherpet-style shot. Either way, nicely done. Lighting seems a little dark, esp. on the right hand side, but the colors are really what do it for me.', '2008-07-26 18:01:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(4845791, 701327, 37104, '<td valign="top">God, I''m such a sucker for this kind of thing. Well done.</td>', 'God, I''m such a sucker for this kind of thing. Well done.', '2008-07-26 18:01:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(4845792, 700757, 37104, '<td valign="top">Kids and Candy, so typical, done so often, but this is done once again so well. Great pose, love the composition, amazing contrast and focus on the candy. Would have liked to see a little more punch in the eyes, but still a great shot.</td>', 'Kids and Candy, so typical, done so often, but this is done once again so well. Great pose, love the composition, amazing contrast and focus on the candy. Would have liked to see a little more punch in the eyes, but still a great shot.', '2008-07-26 18:01:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(4845793, 700215, 37104, '<td valign="top">Oooo!! Different, cool.</td>', 'Oooo!! Different, cool.', '2008-07-26 18:01:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(4845794, 701116, 37104, '<td valign="top">Oh, wow great timing! I''ve seen a lot of these "drop something in coffee" shots, but never from this angle. Way to take and old shot and make it your own.</td>', 'Oh, wow great timing! I''ve seen a lot of these "drop something in coffee" shots, but never from this angle. Way to take and old shot and make it your own.', '2008-07-26 18:01:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(4845847, 701301, 17513, '<td valign="top">what a fantastic photograph...i love the lighting,how the sugar is falling and also the reflection...outstanding 10+</td>', 'what a fantastic photograph...i love the lighting,how the sugar is falling and also the reflection...outstanding 10+', '2008-07-26 18:54:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(4845879, 699249, 79720, '<td valign="top">Don''t really care for the (onboard?) flash lighting, and the composition is far too busy. Maybe if you''d picked just one of the subjects and went with that?</td>', 'Don''t really care for the (onboard?) flash lighting, and the composition is far too busy. Maybe if you''d picked just one of the subjects and went with that?', '2008-07-26 19:48:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(4845882, 701328, 79720, '<td valign="top">A very nice idea that suffers from grainy noise and a bluish tinge.</td>', 'A very nice idea that suffers from grainy noise and a bluish tinge.', '2008-07-26 19:49:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(4845884, 701157, 79720, '<td valign="top">That was a tough meter, wasn''t it? The sugar seems blown out, but I like the setup.</td>', 'That was a tough meter, wasn''t it? The sugar seems blown out, but I like the setup.', '2008-07-26 19:50:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(4845887, 701331, 79720, '<td valign="top">Macro-mania! Maybe just a touch more DoF? I dunno.</td>', 'Macro-mania! Maybe just a touch more DoF? I dunno.', '2008-07-26 19:51:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(4845891, 701299, 79720, '<td valign="top">Neat effect! I''ll bet you got a whole bunch of "honey is not sugar" comments.</td>', 'Neat effect! I''ll bet you got a whole bunch of "honey is not sugar" comments.', '2008-07-26 19:52:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(4845893, 700310, 79720, '<td valign="top">Almost minimalist, I like it.</td>', 'Almost minimalist, I like it.', '2008-07-26 19:53:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(4845897, 700589, 79720, '<td valign="top">Your image seems a tad overprocessed to my untrained eye. Maybe if you''d focused on the neon sign instead of trying to get the whole building involved?</td>', 'Your image seems a tad overprocessed to my untrained eye. Maybe if you''d focused on the neon sign instead of trying to get the whole building involved?', '2008-07-26 19:55:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(4845899, 700709, 79720, '<td valign="top">Last challenge I would have expected to see a cross-processed, "urban acid" technique.</td>', 'Last challenge I would have expected to see a cross-processed, "urban acid" technique.', '2008-07-26 19:56:34.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(4845901, 700737, 79720, '<td valign="top">It''s a wonderful landscape. How many "DNMC" comments have you had so far?</td>', 'It''s a wonderful landscape. How many "DNMC" comments have you had so far?', '2008-07-26 19:57:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(4845903, 701333, 79720, '<td valign="top">Cool setup. I''m not sold on the slow shutter speed for this one, I might have tried to "freeze" the action.</td>', 'Cool setup. I''m not sold on the slow shutter speed for this one, I might have tried to "freeze" the action.', '2008-07-26 19:59:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(4845906, 701193, 79720, '<td valign="top">The crop doesn''t do much for me, it leaves the composition too centered. I think you may have gone overboard on post-processing her eyes, and the whole image seems to lack contrast. If you were post-processing in Photoshop, try playing around with the "curves" adjustments.</td>', 'The crop doesn''t do much for me, it leaves the composition too centered. I think you may have gone overboard on post-processing her eyes, and the whole image seems to lack contrast. If you were post-processing in Photoshop, try playing around with the "curves" adjustments.', '2008-07-26 20:03:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(4845908, 701070, 79720, '<td valign="top">It does make me think "sugar", but the lighting and the chaotic composition are a little off-putting.</td>', 'It does make me think "sugar", but the lighting and the chaotic composition are a little off-putting.', '2008-07-26 20:04:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(4845909, 700351, 79720, '<td valign="top">Sugar...as hard as snow to get the correct white balance.</td>', 'Sugar...as hard as snow to get the correct white balance.', '2008-07-26 20:04:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(4845910, 701305, 79720, '<td valign="top">Love the light-on-white. Nicely done.</td>', 'Love the light-on-white. Nicely done.', '2008-07-26 20:05:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(4845913, 701165, 79720, '<td valign="top">Oh man that looks tasty!</td>', 'Oh man that looks tasty!', '2008-07-26 20:07:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(4845915, 701222, 79720, '<td valign="top">This''ll be on the front page. Maybe even a ribbon.</td>', 'This''ll be on the front page. Maybe even a ribbon.', '2008-07-26 20:08:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(4845918, 700205, 79720, '<td valign="top">hmmmm. How to improve this shot? I would suggest looking at some of the similar entries in this challenge...a white or at lease light background would have helped. Still lifes and studio shots are usually hurt by an on-board flash firing, and we''ll have to maybe focus manually next time.</td>', 'hmmmm. How to improve this shot? I would suggest looking at some of the similar entries in this challenge...a white or at lease light background would have helped. Still lifes and studio shots are usually hurt by an on-board flash firing, and we''ll have to maybe focus manually next time.', '2008-07-26 20:10:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(4845921, 701110, 79720, '<td valign="top">This has gotta be Irene, the kitcen-counter macro Queen! See you on the front page of this challenge. <b>:</b>-)</td>', 'This has gotta be Irene, the kitcen-counter macro Queen! See you on the front page of this challenge. :-)', '2008-07-26 20:12:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(4845923, 701306, 79720, '<td valign="top">Nicely conceptualized! The lighting on the lollipop seems a little "on-board flash"-y, though.</td>', 'Nicely conceptualized! The lighting on the lollipop seems a little "on-board flash"-y, though.', '2008-07-26 20:13:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(4845927, 701246, 79720, '<td valign="top">Nice idea, over-cropped though. Feels almost like a "digital zoom" shot.</td>', 'Nice idea, over-cropped though. Feels almost like a "digital zoom" shot.', '2008-07-26 20:14:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(4845933, 700031, 79720, '<td valign="top">Best of the "horse &amp; sugar" entries I''ve seen so far. Not sold on the post-processing routine, I might have lowered the opacity of the H&amp;S layer just a touch.</td>', 'Best of the "horse & sugar" entries I''ve seen so far. Not sold on the post-processing routine, I might have lowered the opacity of the H&S layer just a touch.', '2008-07-26 20:18:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(4845935, 700728, 79720, '<td valign="top">I like it, the missing eye is frustrating my senses.</td>', 'I like it, the missing eye is frustrating my senses.', '2008-07-26 20:19:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(4845936, 701295, 79720, '<td valign="top">lol. "How far can I push this Lucis Art plugin?" That should be the title.</td>', 'lol. "How far can I push this Lucis Art plugin?" That should be the title.', '2008-07-26 20:20:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(4845938, 701227, 79720, '<td valign="top">Oh, that hamster. It''s a wonder he hasn''t bought the farm yet.</td>', 'Oh, that hamster. It''s a wonder he hasn''t bought the farm yet.', '2008-07-26 20:21:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(4845940, 701334, 79720, '<td valign="top">Sort of an unflattering image of a nice-looking model. I like the B&amp;W post-processing choice.</td>', 'Sort of an unflattering image of a nice-looking model. I like the B&W post-processing choice.', '2008-07-26 20:22:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(4845945, 700336, 79720, '<td valign="top">Could be a stock photo. Not the most interesting choice for a background, it might have been awesome on a white sheet or something.</td>', 'Could be a stock photo. Not the most interesting choice for a background, it might have been awesome on a white sheet or something.', '2008-07-26 20:24:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(4845948, 699642, 79720, '<td valign="top">Something about those pore-level closeups that doesn''t do it for me. Nice expression, though.</td>', 'Something about those pore-level closeups that doesn''t do it for me. Nice expression, though.', '2008-07-26 20:25:56.000000', NULL, 1),
