(4847327, 700835, 91663, '<td valign="top">I didn''t vote in this challenge, but I really like this image. I don''t see why it wouldn''t fare well. Great choice with the reorient--it looks like the sugar is being shot out of it.<br/> <br/>Maybe a little less contrast/further frame of reference on the sugar holder proper would help out those who couldn''t figure out the image.</td>', 'I didn''t vote in this challenge, but I really like this image. I don''t see why it wouldn''t fare well. Great choice with the reorient--it looks like the sugar is being shot out of it. Maybe a little less contrast/further frame of reference on the sugar holder proper would help out those who couldn''t figure out the image.', '2008-07-28 01:43:56.000000', NULL, 0),
