(4847559, 701110, 58785, '<td valign="top">(Oh noooo... <b>the hat losing it''s power</b>... need to charge it)<br/> <br/>Hey Irene, put your hat on and go someplace sunny... *<i>that should do for a while</i>*<br/> <br/>I think I will call you "Macro Irene" until you have a ribbon with a landscape or something LOL<br/> <br/>Good job (I feel dirty when I say this, but it is a nice photo... <img alt="'' . substr(''//www.clipartof.com/images/emoticons/xsmall2/1241_tongue_frozen_to_a_pole.gif'', strrpos(''//www.clipartof.com/images/emoticons/xsmall2/1241_tongue_frozen_to_a_pole.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.clipartof.com/images/emoticons/xsmall2/1241_tongue_frozen_to_a_pole.gif"/>)</td>', '(Oh noooo... the hat losing it''s power... need to charge it) Hey Irene, put your hat on and go someplace sunny... *that should do for a while* I think I will call you "Macro Irene" until you have a ribbon with a landscape or something LOL Good job (I feel dirty when I say this, but it is a nice photo... )', '2008-07-28 07:19:53.000000', NULL, 0),
(4847560, 700757, 53416, '<td valign="top">Congratulations on your first ribbon - great feeling, isn''t it!<br/> <br/>Love the bright bold colours, and his expression is brilliant!  Well done.</td>', 'Congratulations on your first ribbon - great feeling, isn''t it! Love the bright bold colours, and his expression is brilliant!  Well done.', '2008-07-28 07:22:58.000000', NULL, 0),
(4847561, 701110, 67152, '<td valign="top">You mentioned that photographing sugar was more difficult than you anticipated.  I agree with you completely (my entry was horrid!!!) but I think you absolutely nailed it with this entry.  I knew from the thumbs that this was likely your shot - the excellent lighting, the fantastic control of color, the wonderful and simple composition.  Great stuff and congrats on another well deserved ribbon.</td>', 'You mentioned that photographing sugar was more difficult than you anticipated.  I agree with you completely (my entry was horrid!!!) but I think you absolutely nailed it with this entry.  I knew from the thumbs that this was likely your shot - the excellent lighting, the fantastic control of color, the wonderful and simple composition.  Great stuff and congrats on another well deserved ribbon.', '2008-07-28 07:25:32.000000', NULL, 0),
(4847562, 701110, 52549, '<td valign="top">[quote=FocusPoint] (Oh noooo... <b>the hat losing it''s power</b>... need to charge it)<br/> <br/>Hey Irene, put your hat on and go someplace sunny... *<i>that should do for a while</i>*<br/> <br/>I think I will call you "Macro Irene" until you have a ribbon with a landscape or something LOL<br/> <br/>Good job (I feel dirty when I say this, but it is a nice photo... <br/> <br/>LOL! You''re welcome to call me Macro Irene - I''ve been called worse ;-D<br/>And as for your evil dpc hat ways..... It took me a couple of days but I now have the hat completely in my power.... it even suits me (I think  ;-)</td>', '[quote=FocusPoint] (Oh noooo... the hat losing it''s power... need to charge it) Hey Irene, put your hat on and go someplace sunny... *that should do for a while* I think I will call you "Macro Irene" until you have a ribbon with a landscape or something LOL Good job (I feel dirty when I say this, but it is a nice photo...  LOL! You''re welcome to call me Macro Irene - I''ve been called worse ;-DAnd as for your evil dpc hat ways..... It took me a couple of days but I now have the hat completely in my power.... it even suits me (I think  ;-)', '2008-07-28 07:33:40.000000', NULL, 0),
