(4849918, 701171, 41337, '<td valign="top">I like the use of the shallow DOF and the bright background. Overall, good presentation. All this needs is just some more polishing (remove hair on stem, and needle thing in the background what is that?). I agree with what others said regarding the OOF cherry. It''s not a big deal but would have helped your score to have it in focus. In addition, the white background could be whiter/brighter. On my end it shows as slightly off white.</td>', 'I like the use of the shallow DOF and the bright background. Overall, good presentation. All this needs is just some more polishing (remove hair on stem, and needle thing in the background what is that?). I agree with what others said regarding the OOF cherry. It''s not a big deal but would have helped your score to have it in focus. In addition, the white background could be whiter/brighter. On my end it shows as slightly off white.', '2008-07-29 20:26:02.000000', NULL, 0),
