(4851549, 700728, 811, '<td valign="top">Critique Club Critique<br/>by karmat<br/> <br/>Overall, I like this.  It has a very modern feeling to it.<br/> <br/>Compositionally, I think it would be more effective to crop it so that the eye wasn''t showing.  Having the single eye is a bit disconcerting and throws the shot off-balance a bit.  Also, a tighter crop would help to emphasize the sugar on the lips more, whereas now it could be anything (but is assumed to be sugar because of the challenge).<br/> <br/>Technically, you have achieved the high key look well.  However, there is a fine line in HK photography that when crossed, you lose important details.  I think that is what happened on the lips.  If the sugar had been really sharp focused and clearly sugar, I think the shot would have been more effective for the challenge.  As it is, though, there is a lot of detail loss on the lips and it almost looks like she just needs a good exfoliation.  :)<br/> <br/>Again, personally, I really like the shot.  I think for this challenge, though, a stronger focus, and clearer focus, on the sugar would have made it stronger.<br/> <br/>best to you in future challenges.<br/>Karma</td>', 'Critique Club Critiqueby karmat Overall, I like this.  It has a very modern feeling to it. Compositionally, I think it would be more effective to crop it so that the eye wasn''t showing.  Having the single eye is a bit disconcerting and throws the shot off-balance a bit.  Also, a tighter crop would help to emphasize the sugar on the lips more, whereas now it could be anything (but is assumed to be sugar because of the challenge). Technically, you have achieved the high key look well.  However, there is a fine line in HK photography that when crossed, you lose important details.  I think that is what happened on the lips.  If the sugar had been really sharp focused and clearly sugar, I think the shot would have been more effective for the challenge.  As it is, though, there is a lot of detail loss on the lips and it almost looks like she just needs a good exfoliation.  :) Again, personally, I really like the shot.  I think for this challenge, though, a stronger focus, and clearer focus, on the sugar would have made it stronger. best to you in future challenges.Karma', '2008-07-30 16:39:04.000000', NULL, 0),
