(4852490, 699412, 51793, '<td valign="top">Hey look at that... I beat you in a challenge. hahahaha <br/> <br/>I thought this was a good image but I think what might have dropped your score was the lump in the pour. When I saw it I thought it was just really clear and sharp but the lump looked out of place. I thought you would have a body part in your picture or something. hahahaha</td>', 'Hey look at that... I beat you in a challenge. hahahaha  I thought this was a good image but I think what might have dropped your score was the lump in the pour. When I saw it I thought it was just really clear and sharp but the lump looked out of place. I thought you would have a body part in your picture or something. hahahaha', '2008-07-30 23:58:30.000000', NULL, 0),
(4852495, 700375, 51793, '<td valign="top">Yeah if you were to remove all the liquid from the soda that''s about what it looks like. What a great job you did taking this photo and getting it all set up.</td>', 'Yeah if you were to remove all the liquid from the soda that''s about what it looks like. What a great job you did taking this photo and getting it all set up.', '2008-07-30 23:59:29.000000', NULL, 0),
