(4860347, 700757, 78516, '<td valign="top">Cornflakes!! Why didn''t I think of that?! :) <br/> <br/>dssagent88, I apologize for overreacting. It actually wasn''t even your comment that bothered me, it was the one after yours that made me feel like I was being asked to defend myself. And it came at the end of an extremely long day where we had been traveling for hours, we had to stop for car problems, our hotel screwed up and I was exhausted. I think I just read the comments at the wrong time, and I read them on my cell phone where I couldn''t even properly respond until I could find a computer. I should have just waited until I wasn''t so frazzled and then it really probably wouldn''t have bothered me. <br/> <br/>Having said that, it really is TOTALLY freaky how much those photos look alike, lol! How weird! I guess great minds think alike! :)<br/></td>', 'Cornflakes!! Why didn''t I think of that?! :)  dssagent88, I apologize for overreacting. It actually wasn''t even your comment that bothered me, it was the one after yours that made me feel like I was being asked to defend myself. And it came at the end of an extremely long day where we had been traveling for hours, we had to stop for car problems, our hotel screwed up and I was exhausted. I think I just read the comments at the wrong time, and I read them on my cell phone where I couldn''t even properly respond until I could find a computer. I should have just waited until I wasn''t so frazzled and then it really probably wouldn''t have bothered me.  Having said that, it really is TOTALLY freaky how much those photos look alike, lol! How weird! I guess great minds think alike! :)', '2008-08-03 00:06:32.000000', NULL, 0),
