(4876458, 701128, 60862, '<td valign="top">Oh, another Deb special: taking the mundane and somehow, once again, pulling out art.  I chuckled to read most people walked behind you when they saw your camera.  I''ve had the same problem.  I want to yell "NO!  I WANT you in the frame.  Just pretend I''m not here!"  The randomness of it is part of the fun, to see what comes along.<br/> <br/>Anyway, back to your shot, I love how your title reflects not only the product in the window but also the generally dark scene.</td>', 'Oh, another Deb special: taking the mundane and somehow, once again, pulling out art.  I chuckled to read most people walked behind you when they saw your camera.  I''ve had the same problem.  I want to yell "NO!  I WANT you in the frame.  Just pretend I''m not here!"  The randomness of it is part of the fun, to see what comes along. Anyway, back to your shot, I love how your title reflects not only the product in the window but also the generally dark scene.', '2008-08-09 00:56:57.000000', NULL, 0),
