(4896346, 701171, 48228, '<td valign="top">What a lovely presentation. <br/> <br/>I like to share something with you that I learned some time ago with challenges entries. Do your wonderful set-ups, re your ideas and compositions, as you have a good artistic eye. Add a simple thin black, or thin white border, or NO border, as I feel your images are strong enough to stand alone. Leave the more fancy wider colored borders for ''side challenges'' and fun things. <br/> <br/>My scores have definitely improved a lot, since sticking to this rule. This then makes your average improve more steadily, with each challenge you enter. <br/> <br/>Just a suggestion, as you really are doing some excellent images, with very pleasing compositions. I look forward to seeing a lot more from you, in the side challenges, and also challenges.</td>', 'What a lovely presentation.  I like to share something with you that I learned some time ago with challenges entries. Do your wonderful set-ups, re your ideas and compositions, as you have a good artistic eye. Add a simple thin black, or thin white border, or NO border, as I feel your images are strong enough to stand alone. Leave the more fancy wider colored borders for ''side challenges'' and fun things.  My scores have definitely improved a lot, since sticking to this rule. This then makes your average improve more steadily, with each challenge you enter.  Just a suggestion, as you really are doing some excellent images, with very pleasing compositions. I look forward to seeing a lot more from you, in the side challenges, and also challenges.', '2008-08-18 22:22:08.000000', NULL, 0),
