(6770739, 701333, 66384, '<td valign="top">I like it -- simple clean image with good lighting. Maybe people didn''t like the slow shutter speed. You know how much DPC loves tack sharp images, and dislikes blur. I think it''s very clever the way you got the sugar to shoot out sideways from one spoon to the other.</td>', 'I like it -- simple clean image with good lighting. Maybe people didn''t like the slow shutter speed. You know how much DPC loves tack sharp images, and dislikes blur. I think it''s very clever the way you got the sugar to shoot out sideways from one spoon to the other.', '2012-05-16 12:03:52.000000', NULL, 0),
